sequenceDiagram
 actor A as Author
 actor R as Reviewer/publisher
 participant S as Draft service
 participant V as Validator/simulator
 participant D as Release store
 A->>S: Save draft(expected revision)
 S->>V: Schema,graph,translation,price,fixture checks
 V-->>S: Findings and trace
 R->>S: Approve exact hash + publish
 S->>D: Atomic manifest activation + audit
 alt Checks/hash/auth fail
  D-->>S: Reject;previous release active
 else Valid
  D-->>S: New release for new runs
 end
 S-->>R: Status + verification record
